 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Two hundred soldiers march to Caesarea",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Lysias writes the letter with care",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.68,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Brought safely to Felix the governor",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He asks what province Paul endures",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith in Christ Jesus he speaks",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Righteousness and self control",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Judgment to come makes Felix afraid",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "That is enough for now he says",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Five days later Ananias comes",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Tertullus lays the charges down",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Paul defends himself with cheer",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 1.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "I worship God according to the Way",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith in Christ Jesus he speaks",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.04,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Righteousness and self control",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Judgment to come makes Felix afraid",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That is enough for now he says",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.81,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Felix was informed about the Way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.65,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He adjourned the hearing that day",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Wait for Lysias to come down",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I will decide your case",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Faith in Christ Jesus he speaks",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Righteousness and self control",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Judgment to come makes Felix afraid",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "That is enough for now he says",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Days later Felix and Drusilla",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Came to hear what Paul would say",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He listened to the faith in Christ",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And grew afraid in that place",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hoping for money he sent for him",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
